{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年31歲的江嘉敏（Kaman）去年宣布離巢後有一段時間曝光率大減，不過依然積極更新社交平台，全身名牌，生活富貴。早前江嘉敏在國慶日現身沙田馬場，當日她穿上純白低胸連身裙亮相，性感造型引起網民熱議。江嘉敏近日曝光近況，自爆北上去華強北掃貨。</p><figure><img alt=\"前TVB小花藝人江嘉敏（Kaman）去年毅然宣布離開效力多年的無綫電視，結束賓主關係回復自由身。（IG@kaman_kong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260808/1162817467894992896023845.jpeg/S6lhhHDwtrI93vFr3B5JIRkNzkD3vX7NEvMWNRLzFjU\"/><figcaption>前TVB小花藝人江嘉敏（Kaman）去年毅然宣布離開效力多年的無綫電視，結束賓主關係回復自由身。（IG@kaman_kong）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏性感美照獲網民洗版讚好。（IG@kaman_kong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187358379094708224094618.jpeg/R9Z-QIgY6uUAmYZ7AsCXSmTntb64AdKQWptG0VqbRtE\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏性感美照獲網民洗版讚好。（IG@kaman_kong）</figcaption></figure><p>江嘉敏華強北掃貨：買咗勁多嘢</p><p>江嘉敏更新近況，她分享多張在華強北掃電子產品的照片。江嘉敏透露首次去華強北掃貨，更分享一個鐘絕對不夠時間行街。江嘉敏穿上小短裙，騷出美腿。有商家留言：「多謝嘉敏大駕光臨，真係受寵若驚」，江嘉敏回覆：「介紹得咁好！搞到我買咗勁多嘢！」</p><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏華強北掃貨。（小紅書@江嘉敏 Karman）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189320351118004224890146.png/nsZdgbSCwjAlJOjDF-xF7k1CkZjc1Fu1szE_arMxP2o\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏華強北掃貨。（小紅書@江嘉敏 Karman）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏掃電子產品。（小紅書@江嘉敏 Karman）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189320348420935680901562.png/28Ao0z4HLu2g8Pi3w0BCcn3IASGSEfxXCcU_8AnFP_A\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏掃電子產品。（小紅書@江嘉敏 Karman）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏穿小短裙。（小紅書@江嘉敏 Karman）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189320345551900672652489.png/NEs6baejaHEiMWWR9GefJql8ndM6GenOhTcryYU3K8k\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏穿小短裙。（小紅書@江嘉敏 Karman）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏掃貨！（小紅書@江嘉敏 Karman）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189320343156822016361074.png/vuAp7FNoOdQ6SqxZN4d_u0dAomDQY4lxWeze31ns3t8\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏掃貨！（小紅書@江嘉敏 Karman）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"江嘉敏透露買了很多東西。（小紅書@江嘉敏 Karman）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189320340451364864046215.png/CJhOUtLntEpuHJx8UgPSDsVNP6RG3WR-bFBb8mxQW_I\"/><figcaption>江嘉敏透露買了很多東西。（小紅書@江嘉敏 Karman）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T04:24:06.970716+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":476,"images":7,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T04:00:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T05:18:16.248695+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T04:18:36.757723+00:00","content_hash":"63030544addcf994bd6ef8a49dd5e6068b1ca2475252d9f43ce074b746f2d769","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}